Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.02,0:02:51.82,OP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}{\1c&H827B25&}A{\1c&H778D3A&}n{\1c&H6F9B4B&}d{\1c&H66AA5D&} {\1c&H60B56A&}t{\1c&H59C179&}h{\1c&H50D18C&}o{\1c&H48E09E&}s{\1c&H4BE4AB&}e{\1c&H61D8B2&} {\1c&H73CEB9&}d{\1c&H8BC1C0&}a{\1c&HA3B4C8&}y{\1c&HB9A8D0&}s{\1c&HCC9DD6&} {\1c&HE490DE&}w{\1c&HED91D7&}i{\1c&HEE95CF&}l{\1c&HEE98C8&}l{\1c&HEF9EBE&} {\1c&HF0A6AF&}b{\1c&HF1AF9E&}e{\1c&HF2B690&} {\1c&HF3BE80&}h{\1c&HF4C76F&}a{\1c&HE5BE6E&}p{\1c&HCAA57A&}p{\1c&HAF8C86&}y{\1c&H9E7D8D&},{\1c&H8C6C95&} {\1c&H77599E&}t{\1c&H5C41AA&}o{\1c&H4128B6&}o{\1c&H3019BE&}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.03,0:02:59.41,OP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}{\1c&H827B25&}J{\1c&H778D3B&}u{\1c&H6D9F50&}s{\1c&H63AF64&}t{\1c&H5BBD75&} {\1c&H53CC87&}w{\1c&H45E4A4&}a{\1c&H59DCB0&}n{\1c&H74CEB9&}n{\1c&H8FBFC2&}a{\1c&HA9B1CA&} {\1c&HC5A1D3&}m{\1c&HE98EDF&}a{\1c&HEE95CF&}k{\1c&HEF9FBC&}e{\1c&HF0A8AB&} {\1c&HF1B199&}y{\1c&HF3BC84&}o{\1c&HF4C771&}u{\1c&HEAC26C&} {\1c&HCAA57A&}h{\1c&HA88689&}a{\1c&H876897&}p{\1c&H6549A6&}p{\1c&H442BB4&}y{\1c&H3019BE&}!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.88,0:21:22.01,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}A sunny early Sunday afternoon
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.01,0:21:25.06,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Let's go somewhere today
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.35,0:21:31.93,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}It's the same road I'm used to traveling
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.93,0:21:36.44,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}But I can see it sparkling so bright
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.61,0:21:41.95,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}With the sun shining down its warmth
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.91,0:21:46.66,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}And you here by my side...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.66,0:21:51.49,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}I'm already high, high, high {Oh i'm sure of that}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.49,0:21:56.87,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}I feel like dashing out
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.25,0:22:01.72,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Sing, la, la, la
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.09,0:22:07.20,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}My voice out to forever
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.72,0:22:12.14,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}I'm already high, high, high
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.39,0:22:17.59,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Ride the dancing wind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.19,0:22:22.66,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Sing, la, la, la
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.95,0:22:27.87,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}My voice springs up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.65,0:00:11.57,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Choose some bread and a drink for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.57,0:00:12.49,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Aye-aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.20,0:00:14.74,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Without running!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.54,0:00:21.83,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That kid just doesn't listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.66,0:00:27.08,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Now... for a cold, we have water, sports drinks...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.08,0:00:28.63,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,dairy products, and so on...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.42,0:00:32.30,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of food goes down easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.13,0:00:34.90,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, do you wanna get something for breakfast, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.90,0:00:36.22,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Cereal or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.22,0:00:37.22,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.76,0:00:39.22,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.77,0:00:46.77,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Did I make her sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.69,0:00:50.52,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.28,0:00:55.49,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Cold viruses are all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.49,0:00:58.45,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Some will catch it and some won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.87,0:01:03.41,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,There's no reason to worry about where it came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.87,0:01:07.50,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Can I pick something to bring her too?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.50,0:01:08.58,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.92,0:01:15.09,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.84,0:01:20.47,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Put it in the basket.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.39,0:01:26.69,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.69,0:01:29.94,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing in the snacks aisle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.61,0:01:33.94,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki! What about breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.03,0:01:38.32,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It came out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.73,0:03:16.13,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I live here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.55,0:03:23.89,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,We're gonna head home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.89,0:03:25.68,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want your mom fussing over us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.68,0:03:26.60,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.60,0:03:29.47,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Here. Give this food to your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.47,0:03:30.88,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.88,0:03:32.52,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It's {\i1}really{\i0} heavy...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.52,0:03:34.10,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, let's go, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.19,0:03:38.98,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Mom! Daikichi gave us food!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.18,0:03:42.65,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Listen when somebody's talking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.65,0:03:44.28,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, you don't have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.04,0:03:49.58,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.79,0:03:54.50,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for making you look after him all the time...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.50,0:03:58.05,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,O-Oh, no, I owe you for taking care of Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.05,0:04:00.41,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,How is Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.41,0:04:02.47,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She's a lot better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.47,0:04:04.52,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She went back to school today. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.52,0:04:06.22,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hello...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.85,0:04:09.85,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Hello. I'm glad you're feeling better, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.85,0:04:11.12,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.12,0:04:13.77,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm making that rice gruel right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.98,0:04:16.69,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be better soon too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.27,0:04:19.15,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.15,0:04:22.08,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, let's go throw my tooth!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.08,0:04:24.11,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:29.49,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.49,0:04:30.87,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.66,0:04:35.42,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Nitani, you probably caught your cold when you were taking care of Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.87,0:04:37.21,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.79,0:04:39.88,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}We're gonna throw it from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.54,0:04:41.58,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I meet a lot of people every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:41.67,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}It's so high up...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.58,0:04:43.55,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,The train I take to the office is always packed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.67,0:04:43.55,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}I'm gonna throw it on that roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.53,0:04:47.09,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,There's no telling where it came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.09,0:04:49.54,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.54,0:04:51.35,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's just a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.14,0:04:54.73,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.73,0:04:58.73,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, at least let me help with Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.07,0:05:00.82,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I can pick him up from day care.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.15,0:05:04.65,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.78,0:05:08.12,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, we're going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.50,0:05:15.75,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, let's play video games!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.75,0:05:17.62,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sure. Next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.23,0:05:22.09,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, make sure to help your mom out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.80,0:05:25.05,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.39,0:05:32.56,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.23,0:05:36.39,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,The small bottle and pudding are from Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.48,0:05:41.15,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.69,0:05:43.69,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Pudding is my favorite!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.40,0:05:46.36,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.29,0:06:00.13,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.71,0:06:03.30,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You're up early... It's Sunday!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.77,0:06:07.48,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I told you I'm going to practice for the jump rope contest!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.81,0:06:14.93,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.98,0:06:18.98,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This one's wobbly too...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.44,0:06:21.02,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Brush slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.02,0:06:21.98,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.90,0:06:24.99,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't mess with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.99,0:06:26.44,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.71,0:06:30.86,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Oww!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.16,0:06:38.16,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Please don't push yourself too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.16,0:06:41.12,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I'm fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.12,0:06:43.88,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry for always taking advantage of your generosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.88,0:06:46.25,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I think it's the other way around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.25,0:06:48.47,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Really, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.47,0:06:49.51,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.51,0:06:51.51,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm surprised at Kouki...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.51,0:06:54.01,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,For some reason, he just can't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.85,0:06:58.98,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, you're jumping too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.77,0:07:05.73,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,When the jump rope swings around, you jump here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.73,0:07:06.78,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.78,0:07:09.53,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Then you can't move your arms and legs at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.53,0:07:10.65,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.65,0:07:12.45,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Your arms go first, then your legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.45,0:07:14.24,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Try it once slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.24,0:07:15.45,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.45,0:07:17.95,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Me too! Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.95,0:07:21.42,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, okay. Rin, you're swinging your arms too far out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.83,0:07:23.50,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Keep your arms in close like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.50,0:07:25.88,Default,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.88,0:07:28.21,Default,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,You're early, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.21,0:07:30.76,Default,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.76,0:07:32.34,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, aren't they energetic?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.72,0:07:39.47,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Nobu's pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.47,0:07:40.85,Default,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,It's his big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.85,0:07:42.64,Default,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,Nobu mimics everything he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.64,0:07:44.15,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.44,0:07:48.40,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you gonna join them, Sayaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.24,0:07:53.78,Default,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,This time, she lost one of her upper teeth...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.41,0:07:59.74,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Girls have it rough, even when they're little kids...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.16,0:08:05.67,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka, what kind of container are you using to hold your teeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.67,0:08:07.21,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Did your parents buy you a cute one?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.92,0:08:09.58,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,A cute what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.58,0:08:12.69,Default,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know those cases people use to hold their kids' baby teeth as a keepsake?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.69,0:08:13.34,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Keepsake?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.34,0:08:16.64,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,They have these cute tiny ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.01,0:08:15.47,Default,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,Tiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.47,0:08:16.64,Default,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,Cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.64,0:08:17.35,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.35,0:08:20.31,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! Mine is a butterfly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.31,0:08:22.27,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}I bought one for Kouki, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.35,0:08:24.02,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I bet Rin would love that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.27,0:08:24.02,Default,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}We're saving the kids' teeth, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.31,0:08:27.98,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm such an idiot! I had no idea those existed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.96,0:08:32.49,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's been like this ever since I met Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.13,0:08:36.03,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Fretting and getting nervous over the littlest things...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.20,0:08:40.33,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, this is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.33,0:08:41.62,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I drew it at school.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.62,0:08:45.54,Sign,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\pos(426,630)\fs50}Daikichi
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.62,0:08:45.54,Sign,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs40\blur1\an4\pos(695,561)}The stew Daikichi makes is really delicious.\NAlso, Daikichi can run really fast.
Dialogue: 6,0:08:42.62,0:08:44.68,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I had to write about someone at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.93,0:08:48.29,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.92,0:08:52.06,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.06,0:08:52.96,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.96,0:08:55.59,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You put your baby teeth in there when they come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.59,0:08:56.89,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's like a keepsake...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.89,0:08:57.97,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A keepsake!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.97,0:09:00.97,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Mrs. Nitani!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.97,0:09:02.64,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.05,0:09:04.60,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.60,0:09:06.31,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But isn't that Kouki's...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.31,0:09:07.70,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it. It's fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.70,0:09:09.73,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I throw my teeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.73,0:09:10.61,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,...as you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.02,0:09:13.69,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I've been throwing my teeth on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.69,0:09:14.57,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.57,0:09:16.03,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.03,0:09:18.78,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You can do whichever one you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.78,0:09:20.08,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.92,0:09:34.63,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! I'm gonna do my best with this jump rope thing, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.43,0:09:41.30,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You're touching your tooth again...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.30,0:09:43.72,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It'll come out on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.77,0:09:47.56,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No matter what, she's gonna look like someone punched her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.02,0:09:50.73,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,As long as she doesn't smile...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.40,0:09:52.69,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.02,0:09:56.15,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Good. Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.91,0:10:00.87,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Did you grow again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.91,0:10:05.04,Default,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? You too, Daikichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.87,0:10:07.62,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm starting to get a spare tire...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.62,0:10:08.75,Default,Sayaka's Dad & Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.08,0:10:11.42,Default,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,It's tough when you get to be our age.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.42,0:10:13.42,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I just want to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.17,0:10:20.09,Default,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi's doing it boxer-style!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.09,0:10:21.60,Default,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.28,0:10:24.39,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's easier on the knees this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.39,0:10:26.10,Default,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.10,0:10:29.56,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Teach me how to do that, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.02,0:10:31.57,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Forget about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.57,0:10:34.02,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,What?! Only you get to look cool?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.54,0:10:37.74,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Learn how to jump rope normally first!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.74,0:10:38.89,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,What was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.20,0:10:42.53,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.53,0:10:44.45,Default,Nabe,0000,0000,0000,,Me too! Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.21,0:10:56.03,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Rin, you're so good at doing it backwards!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.59,0:10:57.17,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, kids are incredible...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.03,0:10:57.17,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.63,0:11:00.88,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,They have energy to burn, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.88,0:11:02.72,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Rock, paper, scissors!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.76,0:11:04.35,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know where they get it from...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.72,0:11:04.35,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.64,0:11:13.94,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Although adults are incredible, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.44,0:11:15.57,Default,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Adults?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.11,0:11:21.32,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I think you two already know this, but I'm not Rin's dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.32,0:11:24.87,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,We've only been living together for about a year now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.87,0:11:29.33,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Before that, I used all my time for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.03,0:11:33.79,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But once I started living with Rin, my lifestyle suddenly changed...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.16,0:11:37.50,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You guys have been with your kids ever since they were born though...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.63,0:11:43.64,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I've just started, so it's no big deal right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.11,0:11:50.35,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,but I wonder if you guys are fine with no "me-time" down the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.52,0:11:55.23,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.61,0:11:56.56,Default,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.56,0:11:57.44,Default,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.98,0:12:00.15,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.15,0:12:02.24,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Well, after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.37,0:12:07.95,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What? What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.75,0:12:13.87,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, come to think of it, wasn't today the jump rope contest?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.87,0:12:15.16,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.16,0:12:15.79,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.13,0:12:18.88,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I screwed up...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.80,0:12:21.97,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,How many times?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.51,0:12:24.93,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,15 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.93,0:12:26.30,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.93,0:12:30.47,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What about backwards-style jumping?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.56,0:12:35.19,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,203 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.52,0:12:38.32,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You can jump like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.32,0:12:40.53,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna guess you got first place for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.53,0:12:41.32,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.90,0:12:43.65,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Here's my certificate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.65,0:12:46.87,certificate,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(516,90)\frz18.001\blur1}Certificate of Merit
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.65,0:12:46.87,certificate,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(589,275)\c&H727776&\frz18.165\blur1}1st year division
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.65,0:12:46.87,certificate,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs25\pos(668,476)\frz18.165\blur1}1st place, backwards-style jumping rope
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.65,0:12:46.87,certificate,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnComplete in Him\c&H535857&\frz17.759\pos(719,617)\blur1}Kaga Rin
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.99,0:12:46.87,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You really did your best. This is fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.87,0:12:50.37,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But I know I could've done better with regular-style.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.37,0:12:53.29,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, they only gave you one chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.29,0:12:54.29,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.75,0:12:59.13,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well it's true you learned a lot about jumping rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.13,0:13:00.88,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I{\i0} know it, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.67,0:13:03.59,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.63,0:13:06.80,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I lost weight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.47,0:13:09.45,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.45,0:13:10.81,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.85,0:13:15.69,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Are we almost there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.23,0:13:17.98,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe 10 more minutes...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.98,0:13:20.57,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,They'll want to see those wobbly front teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.57,0:13:21.40,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.98,0:13:24.78,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,How many times do I have to tell you? Don't touch them if you can help it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.78,0:13:27.41,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,And I'll show them how I can jump rope, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.41,0:13:28.28,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.16,0:13:31.62,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You've shot up since the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.62,0:13:34.37,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I bet my mom and dad will be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.37,0:13:38.64,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if I'm taller than Auntie now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.64,0:13:41.59,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think you're that tall yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.09,0:13:48.63,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll have to tell Grandpa, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.27,0:13:57.16,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.16,0:14:00.36,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Rin! I've been waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.36,0:14:01.27,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.27,0:14:04.67,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Look at how big you've gotten!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.67,0:14:06.70,Default,Kenji,0000,0000,0000,,Are you one of the taller kids in your class?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.70,0:14:07.68,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.68,0:14:10.78,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,If you'd called, I would've picked you up at the station!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.78,0:14:13.91,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin can walk 10 minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.54,0:14:17.46,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Soon, you'll be taller than me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.84,0:14:27.22,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kazumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.22,0:14:29.28,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yo. You're here early.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.28,0:14:31.26,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I just got here a little while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.64,0:14:32.76,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Those clothes...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.76,0:14:35.14,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You used to wear them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.14,0:14:36.10,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.10,0:14:38.64,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Auntie sent them to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.19,0:14:41.86,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, show me your teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.86,0:14:42.81,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.15,0:14:49.36,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Two of the front ones are wobbly...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.36,0:14:51.66,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay? It doesn't hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.66,0:14:55.29,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Only sometimes, but I'm used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.29,0:14:56.37,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a pro, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.37,0:14:58.12,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.12,0:14:59.96,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't there anything you can do for her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.96,0:15:01.58,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Her gums are turning red! {I assume she means gums and not the teeth}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.58,0:15:03.54,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,There isn't much...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.54,0:15:06.22,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And come to think of it, you wanted to yank out my loose teeth with a thread when I was a kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.22,0:15:07.21,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A thread?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.21,0:15:09.80,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Oh my goodness! Did I really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.76,0:15:13.14,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I tried to make everything soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.14,0:15:14.26,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.39,0:15:19.81,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Wanna have some dried tofu?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.81,0:15:20.75,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.75,0:15:22.69,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll have boiled beans too, Auntie!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.06,0:15:24.27,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.02,0:15:27.61,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Eat up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.03,0:15:34.25,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I love dried tofu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.46,0:15:44.57,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Did one come out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.57,0:15:45.67,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.13,0:15:50.88,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It came out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.59,0:15:53.93,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Blood! Blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.93,0:15:55.55,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Mom! Tissue! Tissue!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.55,0:15:56.60,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.60,0:15:57.97,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.97,0:15:58.97,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, use this for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.97,0:16:00.48,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,That's a dust cloth!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.98,0:16:06.86,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin has changed a {\i1}lot{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.77,0:16:08.90,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.23,0:16:12.24,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This is probably the real Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.24,0:16:13.36,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.36,0:16:16.07,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,So, you're getting married?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.07,0:16:18.25,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Mom mentioned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.25,0:16:19.08,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.08,0:16:22.75,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Good for you. She said he seemed like a nice guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.75,0:16:24.04,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.71,0:16:29.30,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,The only thing I'm not on board with is that he wants to have a kid right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.30,0:16:30.73,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's a good thing, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.73,0:16:32.30,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Are you kidding me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.30,0:16:34.63,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,I wouldn't be able to go out drinking or go to concerts
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.63,0:16:36.22,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,or go on trips or eat delicious food...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.22,0:16:38.51,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,I wouldn't be able to do anything anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.18,0:16:42.02,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you gotta talk to your husband about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.02,0:16:44.19,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I wouldn't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.52,0:16:46.81,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not into kids in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.81,0:16:50.15,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,And I don't wanna become one of those pushy moms either!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.24,0:16:56.62,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think I could sacrifice myself to raise a kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.33,0:17:01.27,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, I think you'd manage somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.27,0:17:02.83,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If you put your mind to it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.17,0:17:05.46,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sometimes you just have to manage...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.46,0:17:08.46,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,Easy for you to say, Dai...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.46,0:17:10.55,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.55,0:17:11.80,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.72,0:17:20.10,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I've never become a father or a husband, let alone a mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.56,0:17:25.07,Default,Kazumi,0000,0000,0000,,It's burning...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.07,0:17:26.14,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.85,0:17:31.27,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,True, I don't have time to shop at my leisure,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.27,0:17:33.15,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,or chat with friends over coffee...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.15,0:17:37.07,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,But my time at work is my own time...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.50,0:17:46.46,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,And my time with my son is also my time...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.46,0:17:47.62,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Precious time...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.62,0:17:49.75,Default,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Other parents might look like it,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.75,0:17:52.63,Default,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,but I don't think they're doing anything special.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.13,0:17:57.55,Default,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,If you look around you, you'll see mothers and fathers everywhere like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.24,0:18:04.89,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.64,0:18:07.23,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.25,0:18:32.38,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.63,0:18:38.30,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Some of my adult teeth are coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.50,0:19:11.67,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.80,0:19:17.96,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Th-This is sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.97,0:19:20.88,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.89,0:19:25.39,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.22,0:19:27.85,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Say "cheese"!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.11,0:19:40.49,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That jar...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.15,0:19:43.37,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Masako had it too...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.78,0:19:47.79,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be right back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.14,0:20:11.23,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.23,0:20:13.98,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What?! The other one's coming loose?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.31,0:20:16.79,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Mirror! Mirror!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.79,0:20:21.57,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure I'll never stop getting worked up over little things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.95,0:20:25.99,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I suppose it's the same way with those two...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.87,0:20:30.50,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.66,0:20:32.96,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.25,0:20:37.54,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.71,0:20:44.01,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What the heck? You look like a cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.01,0:20:45.18,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.18,0:20:47.26,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Send a text to Auntie!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.80,0:20:48.93,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}You mean a photo?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.14,0:20:55.65,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Nevertheless, it seems like that smile will be my joy from now on...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.93,0:20:50.01,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.65,0:20:57.93,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.93,0:21:00.23,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, open your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.45,0:21:07.37,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think there's anything wrong with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.88,0:22:52.22,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Daikichi!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.22,0:22:54.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
